rwater Action</a> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Underwater_Action\" title=\"Underwater Action\">Underwater Action</a>:</b> This item grants the wearer the ability to breathe water as if it were air.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Swim\" title=\"Swim\">Swim +13</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Swim\" title=\"Swim\">Swim +13</a>:</b> Passive: +13 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Swim\" title=\"Swim\">Swim</a> skill.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Plate_Armor_of_the_Deep.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Plate_Armor_of_the_Deep.png/420px-Plate_Armor_of_the_Deep.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"425\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Plate_Armor_of_the_Deep.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>This armor was created for an adventurer who wanted to explore the ocean depths. It provides breathable air and is light and buoyant in water.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817223831\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.105 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3024/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18866/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4331/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n145.59%  130.847     40 Template:IO\n100.00%   89.875      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   89.875      1 -total\n 96.86%   87.057      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 49.71%   44.677      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 48.65%   43.721      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 46.91%   42.156      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 45.77%   41.133      2 Template:InCategory\n 23.18%   20.837      5 Template:Popup\n 19.37%   17.412      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:9857-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817223831 and revision id 633983. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
